<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 559 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 559 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 559 contracts compared with 1,909 overnight Sunday.</p>
<p>There were two wheat, 236 corn, 288 soybean, eight soymeal, 11 soyoil, 10 oat and four rice contracts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was steady to one cent higher, corn was 1/2 to 3/4 cent higher and soybeans were 1-1/4 to two cents higher.</p>
<p>((Sam Nelson 312-408-8721))</p>
